# Trivy Ignore File
# Plain-format rules for ad-hoc scanners. Vulnerability suppressions are not kept
# here: each needs an owner and an expiry in .trivyignore.yaml, and CI reads that
# file. Unfixed CVEs are excluded in CI by ignore-unfixed=true (trivy.yaml).

# Accepted SPIRE daemonset node-attestation & architectural rules
# SPIRE agent/server require hostNetwork, hostPID, root filesystem access, privileged container capabilities,
# and node proxy privileges by design for node attestation and SPIFFE workload identity issuing.
